# Task Checklist Template

## Owner Values
Valid values for Owner field:
- parent - SDD orchestration (parent agent)
- database-schema - Database schema changes
- feature-integration - Feature/api integration
- debug-specialist - Bug debugging and fix
- refactoring-specialist - Code refactoring

## Task Checklist
 ordered list
   li(Owner: database-schema) Run database schema migration if needed. Reference plan.md section X.
   li(Owner: feature-integration) Implement the feature/core changes. Reference spec.md section X.
   li(Owner: debug-specialist) Fix any bugs found during implementation. Reference spec.md section X.
   li(Owner: refactoring-specialist) Refactor existing code to improve quality. Reference spec.md section X.
 ordered end list

## Completion Criteria
- [ ] All checklist items marked done
- [ ] pnpm lint passed
- [ ] Type check passed (pnpm typecheck if applicable)
- [ ] Tests passed (pnpm test or vitest)
- [ ] Documentation updated (if applicable)